About WPP Indonesia &nbsp;

With a population of 260 million, Indonesia is one of the fastest growing and most dynamic markets in the world. Rising consumer disposable income has put Indonesia firmly on the radar for MNCs seeking to invest in emerging markets. &nbsp;

Terrestrial TV still dominates the Indonesian media landscape, accounting for 65% of total ad spend - but digital is entering a period of exponential growth. Around 170 million Indonesians are online, and more than 70% access the internet via mobile. The scale of opportunity to transform this media landscape is unprecedented in the APAC region. &nbsp;

We're looking for entrepreneurial, diligent people to join us on this journey - building impactful solutions for the next era of media. &nbsp;

About the Role &nbsp;

We're looking for a commercially-savvy, entrepreneurial media leader to take ownership of an existing client portfolio - with a clear mandate to grow it. This is not a maintenance role. You'll be accountable for deepening client relationships, expanding scope of work, and converting strong delivery into incremental revenue. &nbsp;

What You'll Own &nbsp;

• End-to-end leadership of the existing business portfolio, with a growth target attached &nbsp;

• Translating brand priorities into commercially successful cross-platform campaigns &nbsp;

• Full-funnel ownership (upper → mid → lower), planned as one brand ecosystem - not siloed activations &nbsp;

• Identifying and converting organic growth opportunities within current accounts (scope expansion, new brands, new services) &nbsp;

• Driving alignment across planning, media, commerce, advocacy and data &nbsp;

• Senior partnership with client stakeholders, including commercial negotiation and renewal &nbsp;

How You'll Work &nbsp;

Lead and integrate teams across: &nbsp;

• Brand &amp; Communications Planning &nbsp;

• E-commerce Planning &nbsp;

• Advocacy / Creator Content &nbsp;

• Biddable Media Execution &nbsp;

• Data &amp; Reporting &nbsp;

How You'll Work &nbsp;

Lead and integrate teams across: &nbsp;

• Brand &amp; Communications Planning &nbsp;

• E-commerce Planning &nbsp;

• Advocacy / Creator Content &nbsp;

• Biddable Media Execution &nbsp;

• Data &amp; Reporting &nbsp;

Set a clear operating rhythm: &nbsp;

• Weekly WIPs (funnel health &amp; priorities) &nbsp;

• Monthly business reviews (commercial + performance) &nbsp;

• Quarterly strategic reviews and forward plans &nbsp;

Ensure planning decisions drive execution - not the other way around. &nbsp;

What Success Looks Like &nbsp;

• Portfolio revenue and scope growth, year over year &nbsp;

• Brands planned and executed as one connected system, not in silos &nbsp;

• Fewer fragmented campaigns, stronger reach, clearer storytelling &nbsp;

• Tighter planning-execution linkage translating directly into commercial outcomes &nbsp;

• Teams operating with clarity, speed and shared accountability &nbsp;

• Clients who see you as a growth partner, not a vendor &nbsp;

Who You Are

• 10-15 years' experience in media, planning, or client leadership roles &nbsp;

• Proven track record of growing existing accounts - not just retaining them &nbsp;

• Strong understanding of full-funnel media and commerce dynamics &nbsp;

• Commercially sharp: comfortable owning revenue targets and negotiating scop

Location : Paris, France (Hybrid)&nbsp;

We Are :

RTB House is a next-generation performance demand-side platform (DSP) that uses proprietary Deep Learning AI algorithms to help brands grow. The company is the market leader in driving performance using Deep Learning across the entire purchase funnel.

Founded in 2012 and now operating in 90+ markets, RTB House has always been private-by-design. It embraces first-party advertising and a relentless approach to innovation. RTB House offers end-to-end Deep Learning-powered AdTech products and solutions to maximize conversion, drive new customer acquisition, create engagement, and fuel long-term demand for a global base of clients.

In 2026, RTB House launched rtb.com, a self-service platform specifically designed to allow small and medium-sized businesses and agencies to deploy auto-built creatives and maximize performance on any budget.

Our team in France consists of 45 people (including 14 Technical Account Managers based either in France or Poland) and is an integral part of our company’s global presence. We combine local expertise with our broader company vision.&nbsp;

As a Technical Account Management Team Leader you will lead and coordinate a team responsible for technical support, oversee the launch and optimisation of RTB advertising campaigns and ensure effective collaboration with clients and internal stakeholders. You will report directly to the Country Manager based in France and the Head of Global Technical Support Solutions based in Headquarters, Warsaw.&nbsp;

You Will:

• Support, coordinate and supervise the work of the team members responsible for the technical support of the company's business teams;

• Launching and optimising advertising campaigns with Real-Time Bidding technology;

• Collaborate with local sales managers and account managers, as well as technical teams and departments across the company;

• Develop tools and procedures in order to improve the work of both your own and other technical teams.

Desired Experience: &nbsp;

• At least 7 years of professional experience, including 5 years in digital marketing (preferably within retargeting) in technical roles and minimum 2 years in a leadership role managing senior team members;&nbsp;

• Good knowledge of online campaign management;

• Knowledge of Firebug tools, Chrome DevTools and debugging tracking scripts;

• Knowledge of HTML / JavaScript, Google Analytics;

• Fluency in English language&nbsp;

• Fluency in French is mandatory for external candidates

We Offer:

• Unique opportunity to join a creative, fast-growing company in online advertising;

• Great opportunity for professional growth by joining the global leader in innovation, to building partnerships with top brands in France;

• A chance to work in a truly international environment with the best people;

• Becoming part of an award-winning organisation, with outstanding growth numbers;

• Opportunity to work on a great product based on the newest AI Technology (Deep Learning);

• Working and learning in one of the fastest-growing tech companies in Europe;&nbsp;

• A rewarding career in a friendly and inspiring atmosphere with no corporate habits;

• Opportunity to contribute to ambitious projects in the growing, international organisation;

• A training program to develop your professional skills further.

Apply now!

You don't need to tick every box to apply. If you are passionate about digital marketing, send us your CV, and we'll review it.

